Package: L0glm
Type: Package
Title: L0-Norm or Group-L0 Norm Penalized GLMs for Best Subset Selection and Best Subset of Group Selection
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-22
Authors@R: c(person("Tom", "Wenseleers", role = c("aut", "cre"),
