Maintainer: Tom Wenseleers <tom.wenseleers@kuleuven.be>
Description: Fits L0-norm penalized or group-L0 penalized generalized linear models
             for best subset selection and best subset of groups selection.
             Supports ordinary GLMs, negative binomial, multinomial and Cox
             models, dense and sparse designs, multichannel responses,
             observation weights, offsets and nonnegative constraints.
             Combines adaptive ridge and IRLS with fast solvers, SIS/ISIS
             screening, information criteria and cross-validation.
